\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Refractive-index structure of the optical model. \emph  {Left:} the index ladder of the bulk media, all wavelength-flat across the visible---fibre core, scintillator, clamp/holder/epoxy, PMMA inner cladding, optical grease and fluoropolymer sheath. \emph  {Middle:} the radial index profile of the multi-clad Y-11 fibre from the core axis outward: core ($n=1.59$), PMMA cladding ($n=1.49$), fluoropolymer sheath ($n=1.42$), the deliberate \SI {0.05}{\milli \meter } air annulus, and the surrounding clamp ($n=1.55$). \emph  {Right:} the critical angles $\theta _c = \sin ^{-1}(n_2/n_1)$ of the successive layer pairs, measured from the interface normal. The large thresholds at the core--clad and clad--sheath boundaries are what sustain core--cladding total internal reflection, while the plate's air interface sets the usual escape cone.}}{16}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:nidx}{{7}{16}{Refractive-index structure of the optical model. \emph {Left:} the index ladder of the bulk media, all wavelength-flat across the visible---fibre core, scintillator, clamp/holder/epoxy, PMMA inner cladding, optical grease and fluoropolymer sheath. \emph {Middle:} the radial index profile of the multi-clad Y-11 fibre from the core axis outward: core ($n=1.59$), PMMA cladding ($n=1.49$), fluoropolymer sheath ($n=1.42$), the deliberate \SI {0.05}{\milli \meter } air annulus, and the surrounding clamp ($n=1.55$). \emph {Right:} the critical angles $\theta _c = \sin ^{-1}(n_2/n_1)$ of the successive layer pairs, measured from the interface normal. The large thresholds at the core--clad and clad--sheath boundaries are what sustain core--cladding total internal reflection, while the plate's air interface sets the usual escape cone}{figure.caption.10}{}}
