\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {13}{\ignorespaces Collection efficiency at the three irradiation patches (centre, edge, corner), one panel per detector layout, with the four reflector curves (logarithmic $y$-axis). All three patches have equal area and lie fully on the plate, so the points are directly comparable. Aluminium and glossy paper are nearly flat across the three patches in every layout; the contact-limited bare plate varies by up to \SI {19}{\percent }, and the diffuse TiO$_2$ paint shows by far the strongest position dependence.}}{25}{figure.caption.19}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:poslayouts}{{13}{25}{Collection efficiency at the three irradiation patches (centre, edge, corner), one panel per detector layout, with the four reflector curves (logarithmic $y$-axis). All three patches have equal area and lie fully on the plate, so the points are directly comparable. Aluminium and glossy paper are nearly flat across the three patches in every layout; the contact-limited bare plate varies by up to \SI {19}{\percent }, and the diffuse TiO$_2$ paint shows by far the strongest position dependence}{figure.caption.19}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {14}{\ignorespaces The same data grouped by reflector (one panel per wrapper), with the four layouts as curves. Aluminium and glossy paper are nearly flat in every layout, while the contact-limited bare plate varies by up to \SI {19}{\percent }. The diffuse TiO$_2$ paint varies by a factor $\approx \!\num {1.75}$ in the four-sided layouts (corner highest); in the single-sided layouts (3 and~4) it drops from centre toward the edge and corner patches, which sit on the far side of the plate from its sensors.}}{26}{figure.caption.20}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:posrefl}{{14}{26}{The same data grouped by reflector (one panel per wrapper), with the four layouts as curves. Aluminium and glossy paper are nearly flat in every layout, while the contact-limited bare plate varies by up to \SI {19}{\percent }. The diffuse TiO$_2$ paint varies by a factor $\approx \!\num {1.75}$ in the four-sided layouts (corner highest); in the single-sided layouts (3 and~4) it drops from centre toward the edge and corner patches, which sit on the far side of the plate from its sensors}{figure.caption.20}{}}
