\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {15}{\ignorespaces Direction-aware light sharing, config~1, one panel per reflector. Each group of bars is one sensor (x axis) and the three colours are the irradiation patches (blue: centre, orange: edge, red: corner); the height is that sensor's share of the light collected at that patch, and the dashed line marks the uniform expectation $1/8$. Glossy paper and aluminium spread the light almost uniformly over all eight sensors (corner max/min \num {1.26} and \num {1.28}), the contact-limited bare plate is intermediate (\num {8.61}), whereas the diffuse TiO$_2$ paint concentrates it on the two sensors nearest the beam (corner max/min \num {11.95}).}}{27}{figure.caption.21}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:sharing}{{15}{27}{Direction-aware light sharing, config~1, one panel per reflector. Each group of bars is one sensor (x axis) and the three colours are the irradiation patches (blue: centre, orange: edge, red: corner); the height is that sensor's share of the light collected at that patch, and the dashed line marks the uniform expectation $1/8$. Glossy paper and aluminium spread the light almost uniformly over all eight sensors (corner max/min \num {1.26} and \num {1.28}), the contact-limited bare plate is intermediate (\num {8.61}), whereas the diffuse TiO$_2$ paint concentrates it on the two sensors nearest the beam (corner max/min \num {11.95})}{figure.caption.21}{}}
