\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Mean photoelectron yield per event for the full-slab irradiation (whole-plate beam, \num {25000} events per cell), for each layout and reflector treatment. Of the \num {400000} whole-plate events, \num {399981} detect at least one photoelectron (detection probability $0.9999525$; the 19 events without a detected photoelectron are 14 in config~3 bare and two in config~4 TiO$_2$, plus one each in config~1 bare, config~1 TiO$_2$ and config~4 glossy), so the mean per detected event differs negligibly from the mean per event; the statistical uncertainties are below the quoted digits.}}{32}{table.caption.26}\protected@file@percent }
