\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {25}{\ignorespaces Detected-photon wavelength distribution, weighted by photoelectron count, for each wrapper (panel) and each configuration (curves), using the pooled data of the three irradiation positions. Configurations~1--3 follow the \SI {457}{\nano \meter } blue scintillation spectrum regardless of sensor count, whereas the WLS-fibre readout of config~4 is green-shifted to $\approx \SI {510}{\nano \meter }$ by the Y-11(200) emission band and the self-absorption along the fibre.}}{42}{figure.caption.35}\protected@file@percent }
